@page "/bolt"
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components

<h1>Bolt Rides</h1>
<p>Get around the city affordably with Bolt, the ride-hailing app (mock info for the MVP).</p>

<div class="card">
    <h3>Why Bolt?</h3>
    <p>Bolt is usually cheaper than street taxis and Uber in Thailand, with upfront pricing and cash or card payment. Great for short hops between attractions.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <p>Open the app to book a ride:</p>
    <a class="btn" href="https://bolt.eu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Bolt</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h3>Notes</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Confirm the plate number matches the app before getting in.</li>
        <li>PIN-code pickup is common at malls and airports.</li>
        <li>Cash is widely accepted if you skip card binding.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
